Z||000009||LoW_KeY||12-20-2001||06:03 PM||||Yeah Jegs said 400-600 for the 3.4, everything they had was stock because the 3.4 is a fairly new engine.<P>I figure if you guys wanna help out though that'd be cool, you'll hear from me on the boards, figure my dad and I will get going on it when it reaches above 50 degrees again.  <P>Here's what I'm thinking so far..<P>Pistons - $400-500<BR>Cam     - $150?<BR>Lifters - $150?<BR>Porting - $100-250?<BR>Balance - $180?<BR>Bored 30 over - $???<P>Powder coated plenum - $400 (that one hurts)<P>Should I nab a high flow oil pump? I got various other things I want to buy that setup for the air filter that the fiero store sells, but from a another member on the board.<P>sound good?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>-KC||||reg||1
